  "description": "The Gaspard 24 is where kids’ bikes meet real mountain bike performance. Designed for riders who are outgrowing smaller wheels and ready to chase bigger adventures, it combines lightweight efficiency, trail-ready components, and a geometry inspired by modern MTBs. The result: a bike that feels fast, capable, and grown-up.\nBuilt around a 6061 T6 aluminium frame, the Gaspard 24 is tough enough for everyday use but light enough to let kids climb, corner, and accelerate with ease. Its Vee Tire Crown Gem tires add confidence on every surface, offering grip on trails and speed on pavement.\nControl is elevated with Tektro mechanical disc brakes, delivering reliable stopping power in all conditions. To match the pace of progression, the bike features a Shimano Rapid Fire 8-speed drivetrain, giving young riders smooth, intuitive shifting and the range to tackle hills or longer rides without hesitation.\nWith its larger 24-inch wheels and premium build, the Gaspard 24 goes beyond being a simple kids’ bike. It’s a stepping stone into the world of real cycling—a machine that encourages independence, fuels adventure, and keeps pace with riders who are ready for more.",
